        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=8\\text{ cm}$",
          "worked": "The diameter is $2\\times8.5=17\\text{ cm}$. The angle opposite the diameter is $90^\\circ$ (angle in a semicircle).\n\nBy Pythagoras,\n$$\\begin{aligned}x^2+15^2&=17^2\\\\x^2&=289-225\\\\x^2&=64\\\\x&=8\\text{ cm}\\end{aligned}$$",
